  "summary_en": "1993 European Commission proposal to amend Directive 86/662/EEC, tightening permissible sound power levels for earthmoving machines (excavators, dozers, loaders) in two stages, extending certificate validity, and allowing economic instruments. It concerns conventional construction machinery noise, not AI or robotics.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
